  "plain": "In 2025 Representative Anna Paulina Luna called for cutting the funding of AARO, the Pentagon office set up to investigate reports of UAP, the official term for UFOs. The Australian journalist Ross Coulthart tells Michels that Luna had been tweeting that week about \"what a hopeless cause AARO is,\" a sign that some in Congress have lost faith in the government's own UFO office."
